WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Beha botlolo ya kgale ya polasetiki pela semela.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Seha botlaase ba botlolo. Boloka sekwahelo.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Etsa masobana a mmalwa sekwahelong, o se kgutlisetse botlolong.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Pata molala o shebile fatshe. Karolo e bulehileng e sale hanyane ka hodima mobu.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Tshela metsi ka hodimo. A rotha butle ka masobana a sekwahelo se patilweng.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Ha metsi a ntse a fokotseha ka botlolong, mongobo o nama mobung o potileng metso.
